.*
.* QSCERT: the certificate displays, Quartz extensions (the other system
.* manages certificates with DCM's web pages, so there is no panel to match).
.* WRKCRT is QSWRKCRT, DSPCRT its option 5, WRKAPPID is QSWRKAPPID.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=LBLCL BASETYPE='CHAR 64'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=STORECL BASETYPE='CHAR 256'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=SHORTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=DATECL BASETYPE='CHAR 19'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=APPCL BASETYPE='CHAR 100'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=LONGCL BASETYPE='CHAR 256'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=KEYSTORE CLASS=STORECL.
:VAR NAME=CRTLABEL CLASS=LBLCL.
:VAR NAME=CRTTYPE CLASS=SHORTCL.
:VAR NAME=CRTEXP CLASS=SHORTCL.
:VAR NAME=CRTSTS CLASS=SHORTCL.
:VAR NAME=CRTDFT CLASS=SHORTCL.
:VAR NAME=DLABEL CLASS=LBLCL.
:VAR NAME=DTYPE CLASS=SHORTCL.
:VAR NAME=DSTATUS CLASS=SHORTCL.
:VAR NAME=DDEFAULT CLASS=SHORTCL.
:VAR NAME=DTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=DAPPS CLASS=LONGCL.
:VAR NAME=DSUBJECT CLASS=LONGCL.
:VAR NAME=DISSUER CLASS=LONGCL.
:VAR NAME=DSERIAL CLASS=LBLCL.
:VAR NAME=DFROM CLASS=DATECL.
:VAR NAME=DTO CLASS=DATECL.
:VAR NAME=DDAYS CLASS=SHORTCL.
:VAR NAME=DKEY CLASS=SHORTCL.
:VAR NAME=DSAN CLASS=LONGCL.
:VAR NAME=DCA CLASS=SHORTCL.
:VAR NAME=DTRUST CLASS=SHORTCL.
:VAR NAME=DSHA1 CLASS=LBLCL.
:VAR NAME=DSHA2 CLASS=LBLCL.
:VAR NAME=APPID CLASS=APPCL.
:VAR NAME=APPTYPE CLASS=SHORTCL.
:VAR NAME=APPCRT CLASS=LBLCL.
:VAR NAME=APPAUTH CLASS=SHORTCL.
:LISTDEF NAME=CERTS VARS='OPT CRTLABEL CRTTYPE CRTEXP CRTSTS CRTDFT'.
:LISTDEF NAME=APPS VARS='OPT APPID APPTYPE APPCRT APPAUTH'.
:KEYL NAME=WRKKEYS HELP='KEYS/WRKKEYS'.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F6 ACTION='RETURN 6'.F6=Create
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:KEYL NAME=APPKEYS HELP='KEYS/APPKEYS'.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F6 ACTION='RETURN 6'.F6=Add
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:KEYL NAME=DSPKEYS HELP='KEYS/DSPKEYS'.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKCRT HELP=HLPCRT KEYL=WRKKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Work with Certificates
:DATA DEPTH=1.
:DATACOL WIDTH=26.
:DATACOL WIDTH=52.
:DATAI VAR=KEYSTORE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/KEYSTORE'.Certificate store
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=CERTS SCROLL=YES HEADSEP.(No certificates in this store)
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ENTER='CMD ?QSCHGCRT LABEL(''&CRTLABEL.'') KEYSTORE(''&KEYSTORE.'')' HELP='WRKCRT/OPTIONS'.2=Change
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ENTER='CMD QSDLTCRT LABEL(''&CRTLABEL.'') KEYSTORE(''&KEYSTORE.'')' HELP='WRKCRT/OPTIONS'.4=Remove
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 105' HELP='WRKCRT/OPTIONS'.5=Display
:LISTACT OPTION=7 ENTER='CMD ?QSEXPCRT LABEL(''&CRTLABEL.'') KEYSTORE(''&KEYSTORE.'')' HELP='WRKCRT/OPTIONS'.7=Export
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ENTER='CMD ?QSASNCRT LABEL(''&CRTLABEL.'')' HELP='WRKCRT/OPTIONS'.8=Assign
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT HELP='WRKCRT/OPT'.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=CRTLABEL USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=30 HELP='FLD/CRTLABEL'.Label
:LISTCOL VAR=CRTTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=7 HELP='FLD/CRTTYPE'.Type
:LISTCOL VAR=CRTEXP USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=10 HELP='FLD/CRTEXP'.Expires
:LISTCOL VAR=CRTSTS USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=8 HELP='FLD/CRTSTS'.Status
:LISTCOL VAR=CRTDFT USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=7 HELP='FLD/CRTDFT'.Default
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPCRT HELP=HLPDSP KEYL=DSPKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Certificate
:DATA DEPTH='*'.
:DATACOL WIDTH=26.
:DATACOL WIDTH=52.
:DATAI VAR=DLABEL USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DLABEL'.Label
:DATAI VAR=KEYSTORE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/KEYSTORE'.Certificate store
:DATAI VAR=DTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DTYPE'.Type
:DATAI VAR=DSUBJECT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DSUBJECT'.Subject
:DATAI VAR=DISSUER USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DISSUER'.Issuer
:DATAI VAR=DSERIAL USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DSERIAL'.Serial number
:DATAI VAR=DFROM USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DFROM'.Valid from
:DATAI VAR=DTO USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DTO'.Valid to
:DATAI VAR=DDAYS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DDAYS'.Days left
:DATAI VAR=DKEY USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DKEY'.Key algorithm
:DATAI VAR=DSAN USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DSAN'.Alternative names
:DATAI VAR=DCA USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DCA'.Certificate authority
:DATAI VAR=DTRUST USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DTRUST'.Trusted
:DATAI VAR=DDEFAULT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DDEFAULT'.Store default
:DATAI VAR=DAPPS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DAPPS'.Assigned to
:DATAI VAR=DSHA1 USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DSHA1'.SHA-256 fingerprint
:DATAI VAR=DSHA2 USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DSHA2'.SHA-256 (continued)
:DATAI VAR=DTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/DTEXT'.Text
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKAPPID HELP=HLPAPP KEYL=APPKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM BOTSEP=NONE.Work with Certificate Applications
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=APPS SCROLL=YES HEADSEP.(No application IDs)
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ENTER='CMD ?QSCHGAPPID APPID(''&APPID.'')' HELP='WRKAPPID/OPTIONS'.2=Change
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ENTER='CMD QSRMVAPPID APPID(''&APPID.'')' HELP='WRKAPPID/OPTIONS'.4=Remove
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ENTER='CMD ?QSASNCRT APPID(''&APPID.'')' HELP='WRKAPPID/OPTIONS'.8=Assign
:LISTACT OPTION=9 ENTER='CMD QSASNCRT APPID(''&APPID.'') LABEL(*NONE)' HELP='WRKAPPID/OPTIONS'.9=Unassign
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT HELP='WRKAPPID/OPT'.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=APPID USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=36 HELP='FLD/APPID'.Application ID
:LISTCOL VAR=APPTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=7 HELP='FLD/APPTYPE'.Type
:LISTCOL VAR=APPCRT USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=18 HELP='FLD/APPCRT'.Certificate
:LISTCOL VAR=APPAUTH USAGE=OUTPUT MAXWIDTH=9 HELP='FLD/APPAUTH'.Client    auth
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPCRT.Work with Certificates - Help
:P.The certificates of one store, by label: servers and clients with
their keys, certificate authorities, and requests waiting for their
certificate. A certificate expiring within 30 days shows Expiring.
F6 creates one; option 8 gives one to an application.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLPDSP.Display Certificate - Help
:P.One certificate's facts and the applications it is assigned to.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLPAPP.Work with Certificate Applications - Help
:P.The application IDs servers and programs name to find their
certificate in the *SYSTEM store. An application with no certificate
uses the store's default. The shipped IDs cannot be removed.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/WRKKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F5=Refresh
:PD.Shows the display again with the current information.
:PT.F6=Create
:PD.Create.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/KEYSTORE'.Certificate store
:P.The certificate store shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKCRT/OPT'.Option
:P.Type the number of an option next to an entry and press Enter. The
options the list allows are shown above it; F1 on one of them explains
it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CRTLABEL'.Label
:P.The label of the file on the volume.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CRTTYPE'.Type
:P.The type of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CRTEXP'.Expires
:P.The expires of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CRTSTS'.Status
:P.The status of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/CRTDFT'.Default
:P.The default of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKCRT/OPTIONS'.Options
:P.Type an option number next to one or more entries and press Enter.
The option runs for each entry it is typed next to, in order.
:PARML.
:PT.2=Change
:PD.Type 2 next to an entry and press Enter to change it. The Change
Certificate (QSCHGCRT) command is prompted for the entry.
:PT.4=Remove
:PD.Type 4 next to an entry and press Enter to remove it. The Delete
Certificate (QSDLTCRT) command runs for the entry.
:PT.5=Display
:PD.Type 5 next to an entry and press Enter to display it.
:PT.7=Export
:PD.Type 7 next to an entry and press Enter to export it. The Export
Certificate (QSEXPCRT) command is prompted for the entry.
:PT.8=Assign
:PD.Type 8 next to an entry and press Enter to assign it. The Assign
Certificate (QSASNCRT) command is prompted for the entry.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/DSPKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DLABEL'.Label
:P.The label of the file on the volume.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DTYPE'.Type
:P.The type shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DSUBJECT'.Subject
:P.The subject shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DISSUER'.Issuer
:P.The issuer shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DSERIAL'.Serial number
:P.The serial number shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DFROM'.Valid from
:P.The valid from shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DTO'.Valid to
:P.The valid to shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DDAYS'.Days left
:P.The days left shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DKEY'.Key algorithm
:P.The key algorithm shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DSAN'.Alternative names
:P.The alternative names shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DCA'.Certificate authority
:P.The certificate authority shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DTRUST'.Trusted
:P.The trusted shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DDEFAULT'.Store default
:P.The store default shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DAPPS'.Assigned to
:P.The assigned to shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DSHA1'.SHA-256 fingerprint
:P.The SHA-256 fingerprint shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DSHA2'.SHA-256 (continued)
:P.The SHA-256 (continued) shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/DTEXT'.Text
:P.The text shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/APPKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F5=Refresh
:PD.Shows the display again with the current information.
:PT.F6=Add
:PD.Add.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKAPPID/OPT'.Option
:P.Type the number of an option next to an entry and press Enter. The
options the list allows are shown above it; F1 on one of them explains
it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/APPID'.Application ID
:P.The application identifier.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/APPTYPE'.Type
:P.The type of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/APPCRT'.Certificate
:P.The certificate of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/APPAUTH'.Client    auth
:P.The client auth of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='WRKAPPID/OPTIONS'.Options
:P.Type an option number next to one or more entries and press Enter.
The option runs for each entry it is typed next to, in order.
:PARML.
:PT.2=Change
:PD.Type 2 next to an entry and press Enter to change it. The Change
Certificate Application (QSCHGAPPID) command is prompted for the entry.
:PT.4=Remove
:PD.Type 4 next to an entry and press Enter to remove it. The Remove
Certificate Application (QSRMVAPPID) command runs for the entry.
:PT.8=Assign
:PD.Type 8 next to an entry and press Enter to assign it. The Assign
Certificate (QSASNCRT) command is prompted for the entry.
:PT.9=Unassign
:PD.Type 9 next to an entry and press Enter to unassign it. The Assign
Certificate (QSASNCRT) command runs for the entry.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
